===Etymology===
From {{etyl|frm|en}}  {{term|révérend|lang=frm}}, from {{etyl|fro|en}}, from {{etyl|la|en}} future passive participle '''[[reverendus]]''', from deponent verb '''[[revereri]]''', ''honor'' or ''revere''.

